        <mxCell id="p5_n2" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#44403c&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;Already an index (0–500), not a concentration. From 2025 the annual value uses a different definition, so 2024 → 2025 is a break in the series. 2026 ends on 31 October and carries a coverage_note.&lt;/font&gt;" style="shape=note;size=14;fillColor=#fefce8;strokeColor=#a16207;align=left;spacingLeft=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1c1917;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;strokeWidth=1.25;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
