        <mxCell id="p6_built" value="&lt;b&gt;Built-up share b within 1 km&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#44403c&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;1 km square centred on the monitor: Δlat = 0.5 / 111.32°, Δlon = Δlat / cos φ&lt;br&gt;b = 100 × (pixels of class 6) / (valid pixels); nodata 255 ignored&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#f7fee7;strokeColor=#3f6212;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1c1917;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;strokeWidth=1.25;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="280.0" y="664" width="560" height="110" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p6_stats" value="&lt;b&gt;Statistics for year y on pairs (b, AQI)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#44403c&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;Pearson r with Fisher-z 95% CI · OLS AQI = β₀ + β₁·b, reported as 10·β₁ per 10 points&lt;br&gt;Tercile gap = mean AQI (top third by b) − mean AQI (bottom third)&lt;br&gt;status = ok when each third has ≥ 3 monitors and r is defined&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#f7fee7;strokeColor=#3f6212;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1c1917;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;strokeWidth=1.25;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="280.0" y="804" width="560" height="130" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p6_trend" value="&lt;b&gt;City trend row for y&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#44403c&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;Built area inside the boundary = Σ rows (class-6 pixels) × |Δx|·111.32·cos(lat) × |Δy|·111.32 km²&lt;br&gt;mean AQI over monitors · poor-or-worse share = 100 × Σ days &amp;gt; 200 / Σ days · partial-year flag&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#f7fee7;strokeColor=#3f6212;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1c1917;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;strokeWidth=1.25;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
