        <mxCell id="p6_a7b" value="&lt;b&gt;A7b · Change 2018 → 2024 (separate endpoint)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#44403c&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;Per monitor: Δb = b₂₀₂₄ − b₂₀₁₈ and Δ hour-weighted annual mean of PM2.5 and NO2 (≥ 6 months in each year)&lt;br&gt;OLS Δconcentration = β₀ + β₁·Δb and Pearson r when n ≥ 8 and Δb varies&lt;/font&gt;" style="shape=process;backgroundOutline=1;size=0.035;fillColor=#ecfccb;strokeColor=#3f6212;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1c1917;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;strokeWidth=1.25;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
